72134=You cannot upgrade your default weapon but every other weapon can be upgraded.
72135=Did you know that you share squad support with your squad members when close enough?  Recons share Intel, Assaults boost armor, Supports replenish ammo.
72136=Grenades don't discriminate - Your grenades can be lethal to the enemy or your squad mates
72137=Coordinate a group device push with your squad mates for devastating effect
72138=Reposition after killing several enemies to maintain unpredictability
72139=A balanced squad of Recons, Assaults, and Supports provides a good mixture of reconnaissance, offensive, and defensive capabilities
72140=Always check your Tactical Suit status before battle.
72141=Shooting from cover greatly improves weapon accuracy and control
72142=Health regeneration only starts after a short period of disengaging enemy
72143=Upgrading your weapon increases its lethality.
72144=While running towards cover, you can use the Cover key to slide into cover
72145=You can choose whether to [Toggle Sprint] or [Hold to Sprint] in the Options screen.
72146=Lower mouse sensitivity if you often overshoot your aim
72147=You capture control points at a faster rate with more squad members on the point
72148=You can change your Avatar picture by clicking on it in the Lobby.
72149=You can invite your friends to play with you by dragging them to the Party bar.
72150=Don’t forget to check out the GRP forums for the latest community news.
72151=Round earnings are primarily time based; the longer you play, the more you get
72152=You can swap devices and weapons by bringing up the Equipped screen in-game. [I] key by default.
72153=You can bring up the Tactical Map in-game.  [M] key by default.
72154=Hold left click and then release to throw a grenade, hold right click and then release to roll a grenade
72155=Nearby squad members share Squad Support benefits and enemy visuals
72156=The Assault's BLITZ device allows him to rush forward and knockdown enemies
72157=If you see a friendly Assault with his BLITZ shield deployed, follow his charge and help him eliminate downed enemies
72158=The Support's APS device provides a spherical area of protection which deflects incoming projectiles
72159=Shooting at enemy's APS depletes its energy at a faster rate
72160=The Support's BLACKOUT device depletes nearby enemies' devices and stuns them for a few seconds
72161=The Recon's SCAN device detects enemy in a narrow arc, exposing their location to everyone
72162=The Recon's CLOAK device energy depletes at a faster rate when moving
72163=When running, you can slide by holding the Cover key.  [Space] by default
72164=Most store-bought weapons last 24 hours.
72165=Tactical Suit degrades per game round.
72166=Equip Tactical Suit Upgrades to maximize the use of tactical suits
72167=Coordinate with your squad and assign responsibilities to tactical teams. E.g. Whiskey team go left and X-Ray team go right
72168=Headshots increase the chance of a critical and do extra damage.
