72453=HOLD THE LINE
72454=ACCOMPLICE
72455=Capturing a control point is the most important objective on the battlefield. It pushes back the enemy and allows your squad members to spawn closer. Get to the front line to capture the point.
72456=Having a good defense on your control point provides a good backbone for the attacking team. It is also crucial to hold the line when your squad is in a winning position to prevent any counter attack. Today, you are tasked to defend the control points.
72457=A Kill Assist is awarded when an enemy that they have wounded is killed by a squad member. Two is always better than one, engaging the enemy together with your squad members increases your chance of survival. Bring it up a notch this time by providing 16 kill assists.
72458=Achieve a total of 5 captures and/or capture assists.
72459=Achieve a total of 12 defensive kills.
72460=Perform a total of 16 kill assists.
