72641=WHO'S THE NOOB NOW?
72642=Assault class specializes in frontal assaults on hardened enemy positions. You'll need some training in order to master the Assault class, your first task is to complete 3 rounds.
72643=Assault rifles are generally all-rounder weapon which is ideal in short-medium range combat. They are useful in breaking entrenched positions with short controlled bursts. To complete this training, take out 15 enemies with the assault rifle.
72644=Shotguns are perfect for aggressive close combat players because they are lethal at short ranges, with multiple pellets projected each shot. However, it is ineffective at long range, so your strategy is to get close to the enemy without exposing yourself before engaging. To complete this training, take out 10 enemies with the shotgun.
72645=Deploying the bullet-proof Tactical Shield allows for a short burst of speed. It is most effective for breaking through heavy enemy gun fire and knocking enemies to the ground. To complete this training, knockdown 6 enemies with the BLITZ device.
72646=When the Area Denial System is deployed, it emits painful microwaves within a long and narrow arc, damaging all enemies while severely disrupting their aim and keeping them suppressed. To complete this training, suppress a  total of 12 players with ADS.
72647=Recon class specializes in gathering intelligence about the battlefield and in removing enemy personnel at extended distances. You'll need some training in order to master the Recon class, your first task is to complete 3 rounds.
72648=Sub-machine guns are the premier rapid-fire close quarters combat weapon. It is the ideal weapon for a swift and stealthy recon to surprise enemies from behind. The high rate of fire and high control allows accurate aim on the head for maximum damage.  To complete this training, take out 15 enemies with the sub-machine gun.
72649=Sniper rifles have high damage and accuracy which makes them ideal for long range engagements. Snipers can provide valuable support to the squad by picking out enemies from far, however they are unsuitable for close combat, so always stay behind your team. To complete this training, take out 10 enemies with the sniper rifle.
72650=Using the latest in advanced metamaterials, the Active Camouflage System (ACS) bends light around you, rendering you nearly invisible for a short while. It is most effective for sneaking up on enemies or bypassing heavily guarded areas. To complete this, take out 6 enemies while cloaked.
72651=The Oracle Digital Interrogator (ODI) scans an area for enemy signatures, revealing them to the Ghost team. Scan for corners to anticipate enemy ambush or fortified positions to plan a tactical assault. To complete this training, detect a total of 24 enemies with SCAN.
72652=Support class specializes in the use of ruggedized electronics to give the members of his unit a substantial advantage over enemy personnel. You'll need some training in order to master the Support class, your first task is to complete 3 rounds.
72653=Light Machine guns are most effective at medium range heavy suppression from fixed positions. However, it is not suitable for running and shooting because of the low mobility and ready time(s) attributes. To complete this training, take out 15 enemies with the light machine gun.
72654=Shotguns are perfect for aggressive close combat players because they are lethal at short ranges, with multiple pellets projected each shot by the 12 gauge shell. However, it is ineffective at long range, so your strategy is to get close to the enemy without exposing yourself before engaging. To complete this training, take out 10 enemies with the shotgun.
72655=The APS Active Protection System deflects bullets by triggering precise airbursts in the way of incoming projectiles, disrupting trajectories. It is best used to counter enemy suppressing fire and backup team mates. To complete this training, deflect a total of 60 bullets using APS.
72656=The BLACKOUT device allows the Support to disable nearby enemy devices for a short period, blinding them in the process. Use it near multiple enemies to significantly cripple their team. To complete this training, use BLACKOUT on 5 enemies.
72657=To start capturing a point, stay within the capture zone. The more squad members in the capture zone, the faster the capture progresses. Do not try to go alone, instead attack in a group to take over the point in the shortest time. Use this strategy and try to capture a total of 3 points.
72658=Defend your point by taking out enemies in the capture zone. You also earn points by killing enemies while you are in the capture zone. Remember, a good defense provides a strong base for offense. Take out 6 enemies trying to attack your point.
72659=In Conquest mode, both sides attempt to capture and hold a series of strategic points across the battlefield. To win, capture all 5 points or hold more points than the enemy when the time expires. The key to winning is to strike a balance of offense and defense based on the situation.
72660=In Onslaught mode, the attacking squad's objective is to capture all 3 points, while the defending squad tries to defend them. Attacking squad wins if they capture all points or they lose when the time expires. Teamwork and coordination will be tested in this game mode. Complete this challenge by winning an onslaught mode round.
72661=The Ghosts are planning an attack on the enemy line and need someone to lead the assault. This is your chance to show the strength of BLITZ. Grab a shield and go knock down 9 enemies.
72662=Enemy forces are advancing towards our positions, we need to halt their attack. ADS is perfect for suppressing them, allowing other Ghosts to push them back. Use ADS to suppress a total of 18 enemies.
72663=You are to join your squad in an infiltration today. They need a recon to slip past the enemy defense and take out key personnel. Plan your path wisely to avoid detection, take out 9 enemies while cloaked.
72664=Artificial Battlefield Intelligence (ABI) detected the enemy's special ops team within the vicinity but lost the trace. Ghost team is dispatched to engage the enemy, use the SCAN to reveal where the enemy are preparing their ambush.
72665=The Ghosts are pinned down by enemy fire, head over to their position and deploy APS to counter the suppressive fire. Charge the APS before activating it to have maximum effect. Your objective is to deflect 120 bullets with APS.
72666=Enemy Special Forces got their hands on high-tech equipments and are proving difficult to deal with. Disabling their electronics will be a crucial factor in today's operation. Use BLACKOUT to zap 6 enemies in a round.
72667=In today's assignment, we need to drive the enemy out of the area with their tails between their legs. Prove that you are the best by winning 3 conquest rounds with all points secured.
72668=Leave nothing, take everything! Now is your chance to demonstrate your teamwork and coordination; defend or capture all three points and win 3 onslaught rounds.
72669=Once you are confident with your aim, bring your skills up a notch by aiming for the head. When engaging an enemy in close combat, you need to take him out as quickly as possible, so hit him on the head for huge damage bonus. Get out there and score 10 headshot kills today.
72670=Critical hit deals much more damage than a normal hit. Increase your chance of dealing a critical hit by shooting from cover, staying still, and/or lowering your stance. A critical hit is shown by a red cross on the enemy's body. Give it a try and score 30 critical hits today.
72671=Making use of the cover is crucial to survival, not only does it shield you from fire, it gives you more stability and reduces your exposure. Kill 15 enemies while in cover.
72672=When you are low on health, avoid engaging enemy to regenerate your health and live to fight another day. Remember what I've said and regenerate at least 30% of health.
72673=On the battlefield, you have limited ammunition, so make your shots count. Try shooting only when you have aim on the enemy instead of holding the trigger down all the way. You will learn that not only you will save ammunition, your shots are more accurate with the controlled bursts. For a start, aim for at least 30% accuracy in a round.
72674=Grenade is a useful anti-personnel weapon that a smart soldier bring to the battlefield. They can be used to take out a tight enemy squad or roll it next to the enemy hiding behind cover. Give it a try and kill 3 enemies with grenade.
72675=A Kill Assist is awarded when an enemy that you have wounded is killed by a team mate. Wound the enemy whenever you have the opportunity and make it easier for your team mates to take them out. Work together with your team when engaging enemies by providing 8 kill assists.
72676=So you think you are the best soldier? Prove it by achieving the highest score in your squad.
72677=In the previous after action reviews, there has been good feedback on how you successfully captured enemy's position. In today's challenge, step it up by capturing the most points in a round.
72678=There are some rumors going around that the enemy's heads were all punctured by you. Let's see if that was a fluke, achieve the most headshot kills in a round.
72679=Ghosts are all marksmen who excel in precision shooting, prove that you are worthy by achieving the highest accuracy in a round.
72680=Ghost's sixth sense for enemies is what separates them from normal soldiers. They are able to take out scores of enemies and still come back alive. Prove that you are worthy by achieving the longest kill streak in a round.
72681=Elite soldiers are separated from normal soldiers by their kill streaks. It requires a good sense of enemy's position and a good aim to rack up continuous kills without dying. Prove that you are one of them by killing 5 enemies without dying.
72682=I'm sure you get teased or mocked by senior soldiers sometimes, this is your chance to prove that you are better than them. Take out an enemy who is 10 levels higher.
72683=Complete 3 rounds with Assault class.
