72693=Complete 3 rounds with Support class.
72694=Kill a total of 15 enemies with Light Machine Gun
72695=Kill a total of 10 enemies with Shotgun
72696=Deflect a total of 60 bullets with APS.
72697=Use BLACKOUT on 5 enemies in total.
72698=Capture a total of 3 control points.
72699=Achieve a total of 6 defensive kills.
72700=Win a Conquest mode round.
72701=Win an Onslaught mode round.
72702=Use the BLITZ device to knockdown a total of 9 enemies.
72703=Deal a total of 240 damage with ADS.
72704=Kill a total of 9 enemies while cloaked.
72705=Detect a total of 36 enemies with SCAN.
72706=Deflect 120 bullets with APS Shield.
72707=Use BLACKOUT on 6 enemies in a round.
72708=Win 3 conquest mode rounds by securing all points
72709=Win 3 onslaught mode rounds by capturing/defending all points.
72710=Achieve a total of 10 headshot kills.
72711=Achieve a total of 30 critical hits.
72712=Kill a total of 15 enemies while in cover.
72713=Regenerate > 30% of your health at one go
72714=Achieve >30% accuracy in a round with at least 20 shots fired.
72715=Kill 3 players with grenade in a round.
72716=Perform a total of 8 kill assists.
72717=Achieve the highest score in your squad.
72718=Capture the most points in a round.
72719=Achieve the most headshot kills in a round.
72720=Be the most accurate player in a round.
72721=Achieve the longest kill streak in a round.
72722=Achieve 5 kill streak.
