72724=Good job on completing the rounds, but you still have a lot to prove yourself. Get prepared for tomorrow's training session where you will be trained to handle advanced weaponry.
72725=Now that you are familiar with the assault rifle, we'll continue the weapons training tomorrow with Shotgun.
72726=After you are familiar with the weapon classes, you should learn to choose the right weapon class that suits your style. Next training session, you will be introduced to the Assault class devices.
72727=Did you enjoy knocking down enemies with BLITZ? If not, look out for tomorrow's training as we introduce you to another high tech equipment.
72728=Congratulations on completing the last challenge in Assault Initiation. Get ready for more difficult challenges ahead!
72729=Good job on completing the rounds, but you still have a lot to prove yourself. Get prepared for tomorrow's training session where you will be trained to handle advanced weaponry.
72730=Now that you are familiar with the sub-machine gun, we'll continue the weapons training tomorrow with Sniper Rifle.
72731=After you are familiar with the weapon classes, you should learn to choose the right weapon class that suits your style. Next training session, you will be introduced to the Recon class devices.
72732=Did you enjoy backstabbing enemies with CLOAK? If not, look out for tomorrow's training as we introduce you to another high tech equipment.
72733=Congratulations on completing the last challenge in Recon Initiation. Get ready for more difficult challenges ahead!
72734=Good job on completing the rounds, but you still have a lot to prove yourself. Get prepared for tomorrow's training session where you will be trained to handle advanced weaponry.
72735=Now that you are familiar with the light machine gun, we'll continue the weapons training tomorrow with Shotgun.
72736=After you are familiar with the weapon classes, you should learn to choose the right weapon class that suits your style. Next training session, you will be introduced to the Support class devices.
72737=Did you enjoy the protection that APS provides? If not, look out for tomorrow's training as we introduce you to another high tech equipment.
72738=Congratulations on completing the last challenge in Support Initiation. Get ready for more difficult challenges ahead!
72739=Great job on capturing the points, you should now have an understanding on how to effectively capture points. Next challenge, you will try defending instead.
72740=You have been a great help with defending, remember what you've learnt and apply them in future matches.
72741=Congratulations on winning the conquest round. I'm sure this is the first of the many rounds you will win.
72742=Winning an onslaught round is a good start, keep up the good work and continue this winning mentality.
72743=You have proven to be effective with  the BLITZ shield, keep this up and soon enemies will cower with fear when they see your shield.
72744=Excellent job Ghost, we were able to push the enemies back with your help. You are becoming an asset on the battlefield.
72745=The infiltration was a success, the enemy morale were hit severely with the stealth kills.
72746=Your assistance proved to be valuable as the enemy's location was exposed by the SCAN.
72747=Thanks to your help, the Ghost team was able to break free from the suppression and launch a counter attack. Keep up the good work!
72748=Your squad members were impressed with you today as you showed bravery and intelligence when you managed to get close to the enemy and hit them with BLACKOUT.
72749=You have demonstrated the ability to lead the assault squad to capture enemy positions. Your contribution was crucial on the battlefield today.
72750=Thanks to the strong defense, the squad was able to hold the line and launch a counter attack. Continue to improve and your defense line will be impenetrable.
72751=What an astounding victory! We managed to capture the whole area, forcing the enemy back.
72752=The squad demonstrated great teamwork and coordination to secure the whole map. The squad's morale are high, keep up the good work soldier.
72753=Great job, they didn’t know what hit them. This is your first step to becoming an elite soldier. Keep it up!
72754=While others might think that critical hit is lucky, smile to yourself cause you have learnt how to utilize it. Bring this knowledge to good use on the battlefield and you will surely improve your kill count.
72755=So have you learnt the importance of cover when you mow down rushing enemies from the comfort of cover? Remember what you have learnt today and apply it on future battles.
72756=I'm sure your survival rate will increase if you apply this knowledge on the battlefield. "More haste, less speed".
72757=Nice work, this is a good start to making your shots count. You'll thank yourself when you encounter a second enemy and still have enough rounds in the clip to take him out instead of having to reload.
72758=Did you enjoy blasting the enemies away? Make it a habit to equip grenades, you won't regret it.
72759=The teamwork in taking out enemies helped to increase the survival rate of your squad members. Your team mates who survived will in turn contribute when taking out enemies.
72760=Because of your assists, your squad was able to rack more kills in total. You have shown that you can be a great team player.
72761=The fellow Ghosts were impressed by your work. Continue this performance and soon your squad members will recognize your ability.
72762=You were a critical member in your squad, being focused on the mission objective helped your squad push forward.
72763=You've proven to be a lethal killer among your squad. The enemy were demoralized when  they saw what happened to their comrades.
72764=Excellent shooting Ghost! You have shown a good example to other Ghosts on how to aim before shooting.
72765=You have crushed critics and proven to handle things yourself on the battlefield. Good work soldier!
72766=Impressive!  You have a good sense of the battlefield by knowing where the enemies were and taking them out with such precision showed that you are among the elite.
72767=Nicely done soldier, you should have seen the look on his face. You showed that skills matter more than experience.
72768=SPECIAL FORCES
72769=THE BASTERDS
