72777=EVERYONE IS HERE
72778=BAND OF BROTHERS
72779=FIRETEAM
72780=DOUBLE THE FUN
72781=We have an operation today to take out enemy forces and secure the area. However we are heavily outnumbered, we need your squad's help to reduce their numbers. Form a fireteam and take out 50 enemies in a round.
72782=We've done a good job chipping away at enemy forces, but it's still not enough. This time, we need you to form a stronger team to take out a hundred of them in a round. You will need to form a fireteam of elite Ghosts to carry out this task.
72783=This is a tough challenge, you'll need to form a fireteam capable of killing twice as many enemies. Form a fireteam of 4 and achieve a party kill/death ratio of 2:1.
72784=Use fire and maneuver tactic when you are in a fireteam. A soldier sets up a base of fire to suppress the enemy, allowing another soldiers to advance, and will in turn stop and begin suppressing to start the cycle again. Form a fireteam of at least 2 soldiers and achieve an overall kill/death ratio of 2:1.
72785=A squad needs to gain fire superiority over the enemy by suppressing the enemy with high volume of fire. The squad members can then advance under cover fire. Work with your fireteam to provide cover fire by firing a total of 3000 bullets in a round.
72786=An effective squad is a balanced team of the 3 classes, not having any one of them can cost your squad when the situation for their need arises. Form a fireteam of at least 1 Assault, 1 Recon and 1 Support, and win 2 rounds.
72787=Assault Ghosts are great leaders in offense where they are able to punch through enemy lines and also boost the armor and health regeneration of nearby squad members. Complete 4 rounds with an Assault in your fireteam.
72788=Recons are your eyes and ears on the battlefield, providing valuable intel of enemy positions. They are critical in identifying flanking attackers or entrenched defenders, so that the squad can make the right decisions on the field. Complete 4 rounds with a Recon in your fireteam.
72789=Supports are excellent defenders and instrumental attackers. They can resupply ammo or recharge your device. Complete 4 rounds with a Support in your fireteam.
72790=Nothing beats fighting as a team with your friends and win. Bring out your team spirit and coordinate together to defeat the opposing team in 3 rounds with a full party size of 8.
72791=Having familiar team mates around you results in better understanding and better team work, increasing your chances of success. Work together with your team mates and win 3 rounds with a party size of at least 6.
72792=Forming a fireteam also means that you will be placed in the same squad. This allows you to fight together and have more squad members whom you are familiar with. Maximize the use of fireteam by forming a fireteam of 4 and win a round.
72793=Squad support's range increases when shared with fireteam members, allowing you to receive intel and other class benefits more easily. Form a fireteam with your friend and win 2 rounds together.
72794=50 kills by your fireteam in a round.
72795=100 kills by your fireteam in a round.
72796=Party kill/death ratio of 2:1 at end of round, with party size of at least 5-8.
72797=Achieve an overall kill/death ratio of 2:1 with your fireteam at the end of a round.
72798=Fire a total of 3000 bullets by your fireteam in a round.
72799=Complete 2 rounds with at least 1 Assault, 1 Recon, and 1 Support in the fireteam.
72800=Complete 4 rounds with at least 1 Assault in the fireteam.
72801=Complete 4 rounds with at least 1 Recon in the fireteam.
72802=Complete 4 rounds with at least 1 Support in the fireteam.
72803=Win 3 rounds with a party size of at least 8.
72804=Win 3 rounds with a party size of at least 6.
72805=Win 1 round with a fireteam size of 4.
72806=Win 2 rounds with a fireteam.
72807=Enemy forces were weakened and were forced to retreat thanks to your fireteam's help.
72808=The enemy were obliterated by your fireteam. You guys are becoming notorious and fear is spreading in the enemy camp.
72809=You have found yourself a team of elite soldiers who are worth 2 men in each of them.
72810=Great job, the fire and maneuver tactic proves to be a very useful tactic on the field. You have proven to be an effective fireteam.
72811=Good work, the enemies were pinned down by the rain of suppressive fire, continue this strategy and don’t give the enemy any chance of counter attack.
72812=Practice more to learn how the 3 classes can complement each other to create a formidable team.
72813=Well done! You've coordinated well with the Assault in attacking the enemy positions.
72814=Once again, the Recon proved to be a valuable asset on the battlefield. Intel on the enemy helped the squad react to situations appropriately.
72815=The Support was vital to provide a relentless assault on the enemy with continuous bullet fire. Stick close to him and you will never run out of ammo.
72816=Excellent job on forming a squad of brothers in arms. Coordination through communication is crucial when the squad is huge, appoint a squad leader to control the direction, position and rate of movement of the squad.
72817=The enemies had no chance against a highly coordinated squad. However, your team still showed cracks in team work. Improve on it by forming a full party of 8.
72818=Your fireteam showed great team work to defeat the enemy.
72819=As you can see, fighting with a fireteam is always better than going alone. Recruit more friends to your fireteam for more mayhem!
