73137=SS51 Silencer
73138=Reduces weapon muzzle flash.
73139=Reduces firing noise, muzzle flash, damage and improves control. Silenced bullet tracers are not visible.
73140=Improves weapon control.
73141=Shearwater 51 has been seized by Phantom forces. The oil rig is a cover for tectonic weapon testing. Reclaim the facility and ensure that the research doesn’t get into the wrong hands.
73142=Intelligence reports revealed that the Phantoms are using the Korolyov Towers as an entry point to the Moscow Metro system, specifically Markov Station. Secure the rooftop and gain access to the Metro to cut off Phantom reinforcements.
