73209=ABI has intel on increased enemy activities, we will be launching a pre-emptive strike to destroy their armory. However the numbers are not in our favor, we need you to utilize ADS to engage any enemy that tries to flank us. Equip the ADS and deal 240 damage.
73210=I was separated from the fireteam in the ambush earlier, three hostiles managed to corner me and their bullets are chipping away at my cover. With nowhere to run, my only chance of rejoining the fireteam is to bulldoze my way through with the BLITZ shield. With a deep breath, I went for it...
73211=Charlie Ghost team are getting pounded badly in a fierce fire fight, they need our assistance. The Assault class's squad support will be ideal for this rescue operation to increase the survivability of the squad. Equip any Assault squad support and stay close to squad for 20 minutes.
73212=Intel suggests that the enemy has gotten their hands on the Active Camouflage System and is planning to sabotage key military establishments. JSOC is sending a team of Recons to detect cloaked enemies. Equip the ODI equipment, and detect 5 cloaked enemies.
73213=Enemy forces are getting bolder with the new advanced equipment they have. Let's remind them that we are still king, use CLOAK and assassinate 6 enemies while their devices are activated.
73214=Stand To! Stand To! Hostiles approaching in a 180 degree arc. Recon! Get your squad support ready to provide intel on enemy locations and stay close to the squad. Equip the Recon squad support and stay close to squad for 20 minutes.
73215=Today we will be launching an assault on a fortified enemy defense line. We'll need the APS shield to draw enemy fire, giving the rest of the squad an opportunity to advance. While doing that, reduce the enemy numbers by killing 9 of them.
73216=We have reports coming in that the enemy have deployed Special Forces with advanced devices and are hitting hard on our allies. We need to stop them immediately, equip BLACKOUT for this deployment, and zap 10 enemies while their device is activated.
73217=The fight is taking too long and Delta Ghost team's resources are running out. We will be deployed to provide support. Equip the Support squad support and stay close to the squad for 20 minutes for them to refill.
73218=Morale has been low lately due to the recent defeats. Let's raise the spirit by defeating the enemies today! Get out there and win 3 rounds of any game mode.
73219=We are planning to retake the strategic position which the enemy took from us yesterday. Our squad will be leading the attack, help us out by making 12 offensive kills.
73220=A soldier's score tells you how well he has performed. You gain the most score points when you contribute to the team objectives. Show me how effective you are on the battlefield by racking up some score points today.
73221=There are several advantages of using cover: protection from enemy fire, increased health regeneration, increased accuracy, and it conceals most of your body when peeking to shoot. Utilize the cover well and kill 20 enemies while peeking from cover.
73222=Many soldiers have been sacrificed because they are too impatient and rush out recklessly. You need to stick together with your squad and make sure you are covered before advancing. Try to achieve a lifespan of 2 minutes after completing 3 rounds.
73223=In the Ghost Recon team, we focus on teamwork rather than individual effort. Every damage done to the enemy makes it easier for other team mates to take them out. Try to deal a total of 5000 damage
73224=We can only carry limited number of grenades in each deployment and we should only use it when we are sure of the target location. Use it when there are multiple enemies at the same spot. Try to kill 1 enemy with every 2 grenades thrown.
73225=BLITZ shields can be used to push through our defense line and knockdown friendlies. Cut down 3 Assaults while they are using BLITZ before they can cause any harm.
73226=Enemies can utilize ADS to pin down and suppress our movements. Take out 3 Assaults while they are using ADS before they can flank us.
73227=Enemies with APS shield can be a major barrier to our advancement, but they are vulnerable to explosives and close range combat. Take out 3 Supports while they are using APS shields.
73228=A strategic, well timed BLACKOUT blast can cripple our team effectiveness. We need to prevent this from happening, cut down 3 Supports while they are charging the BLACKOUT.
73229=Cunning enemy recons who use Cloak to get behind our defense line can be a real pain in the neck. Get rid of these rascals for us by killing 3 Recons who are cloaked.
73230=Enemy Recons can use SCAN to give off our location,  expose flanking maneuvers, and alert previously unsuspecting enemies. You are tasked to take out 3 Recons while they are using SCAN.
73231=Ghosts who stick together and have cross-links will receive the squad support from each other. There are bonuses that increases survivability, intel sharing, and resource replenishments. Share your squad support with your squad members for a duration of 5 minutes in a round.
73232=In some tight situations where you are close to the enemy, hand-to-hand combat is required. Prove that you have what it takes to be a Ghost by killing 5 enemies with melee attack in a round.
73233=Sometimes when you see a squad coming at you, the best solution is to take all of them out with grenade. Give it a try and kill 3 enemies with 1 grenade.
73234=Grenades are very useful when dealing with enemy APS shield due to their slow movement speed. Aim your grenade to land in the middle of the APS for a sure hit. Use grenades to kill 3 Supports while their APS is activated.
73235=Your Assault Rifle proficiency has been improving, but it's not quite there yet. Get out there and kill a total of 30 enemies with Assault Rifle.
73236=Your Shotgun proficiency has been improving, but it's not quite there yet. Get out there and kill a total of 30 enemies with Shotgun.
73237=Your Sub-Machine Gun proficiency has been improving, but it's not quite there yet. Get out there and kill a total of 30 enemies with Sub-Machine gun.
73238=Your Sniper Rifle proficiency has been improving, but it's not quite there yet.  Get out there and kill a total of 30 enemies with Sniper Rifle.
73239=Your Light Machine Gun proficiency has been improving, but it's not quite there yet.  Get out there and kill a total of 30 enemies with Light Machine Gun.
73240=Operation Lost & Found: JSOC is responding to reports of a lost Russian ICBM in Chertanovo. Intel picked up enemy forces in the area, so Ghost teams will be deployed in this high risk operation. Alpha Ghost team will be leading the assault. Achieve a total of 10 offensive kills.
73241=We have stirred up the hornet's nest with the previous attack. They must have realized who they were dealing with and are sending Supports with APS shield to halt our assault. We need to take out the Supports quick, you take 3 of them while we handle the rest.
73242=Take cover! We are being pinned down by enemy ADS, we can't advance with the scorching heat in front of us. I'll provide the distraction, and you will flank the enemy and cut down the 3 Assault class enemy using ADS.
73243=Alright, the target is in sight but is heavily defended. Time is running out, this is our last push. Take control of the whole map by capturing all the points. Watch your fire, we want the ICBM back in one piece.
73244=Operation Midnight Oil: Shearwater 51 is being attacked by hostile forces. The oil is not the only target, the oilrig also provides a platform for further assaults. We have orders not to use any explosives to prevent any major damage, so watch your fire.
73245=SCAN revealed multiple squads guarding on both sides, this is more than what we expected. Switching to plan B; we'll concentrate our attack on one area first. We'll need to gather together in squad formation and utilize our squad support to the full potential.
73246=Contact! Enemy special forces spotted at nine o'clock! They must have been alerted by the gun fire earlier and tried to flank us. We need to take them out to secure the next point, kill 5 enemies of each class and capture point A.
73247=We have reduced their numbers significantly and the enemies are forming their last gasp defense. We need to capture the last point to take control of the oilrig.
73248=It seems our fight is not yet over, the enemy is sending reinforcements and is aiming to retake the oilrig. JSOC is sending more Ghost teams to help us out. We can't let them take any points on Shearwater 51 after all the hard work we've done. Man your positions!
73249=Operation Chimney Sweep: Ghost team have been requested for a special assignment to capture and destroy a Russian Anti-Missile Defense system built under the disguise of office buildings. Satellite images suggests that the building is heavily guarded, so the best option is to approach from nearby rooftops.
73250=Take cover! Sniper fire is coming from multiple directions.  We are pinned down and we can't advance until the snipers have been taken care of. We'll provide covering fire and distract them while you try to get closer to the sniper positions.
73251=The situation is becoming challenging by the minute as enemies are growing in numbers. More Ghost teams are on their way but we'll need to secure a forward base for quicker allied reinforcements.
73252=Now that the reinforcements have arrived, we are planning to take over the rooftop in a single well coordinated swoop. Grenades will come in handy as the enemies are well fortified behind covers. This is the final push, let's move out!
73253=The enemies are making a last ditch attempt at retaking Korolyov Towers and stopping us from destroying it. Everyone man your positions, we must not let the enemy overrun us!
73254=It's important to know and understand your party members for better teamwork. Try to make friends in GRP and party together often to get a better understanding of each other. Start off with by completing 3 rounds with 1 friend.
73255=Playing with a squad of multiple friends can be very effective when you form a fire team to attack a match objective together. Practice forming squad formations and complete 3 rounds with at least 3 friends.
73256=When you are playing with a large group of friends, communication is crucial to ensure that players cooperate and work together. It is recommended to select an experienced squad leader to direct the team. Give it a try by completing 3 rounds with at least 5 friends.
73257=Ghosts are launching an assault on Chertanovo to secure a lost Russian Topol. They are requesting for reinforcements, gather your squad and win 3 rounds on Chertanovo LZ with a fireteam.
73258=Shearwater 51 is being attacked and we are sending Ghost teams in to retake the place. We are still short of a squad, gather your fireteam and win 3 rounds on Shearwater 51.
73259=Reinforcements are required in the 2nd wave of attack on Korolyov Towers. Ready up your squad and be prepared to be deployed to Russia.  Win 3 rounds of Korolyov Towers with a fireteam.
73260=Your fireteam have been training a lot lately, I'm sure you are hungry for some action. Good news, we have an order to secure a location, get your fireteam ready for deployment. Win a Conquest mode round by securing all points with a fireteam.
73261=I've read the battle report from recent deployments and noticed that your fireteam has been doing very well. I'm sure your team is more than capable in this next challenge. Win an onslaught mode round by capturing/defending all points.
