73296=Win Chertanovo LZ by capturing all points.
73297=Complete 3 rounds on Shearwater 51 without using any explosives.
73298=Share squad support for 5 minutes and capture Shearwater 51 point B in a round.
73299=Kill a total of 5 Assault, 5 Recon, and 5 Support enemies in Shearwater 51 and capture point A.
73300=Take part in capturing point C on Shearwater 51.
73301=Achieve 5 defensive kills and successfully defend Shearwater 51 in a round.
73302=Kill a total of 30 enemies in Korolyov Towers.
73303=Kill a total of 10 enemy Recon snipers in Korolyov Towers.
73304=Take part in capturing point A and B of Korolyov Towers in a round.
73305=Kill 3 enemies with grenade and capture Korolyov Towers point C in a round.
73306=Achieve 5 defensive kills and successfully defend Korolyov Towers in a round.
73307=Complete 3 rounds with a party consisting of at least 1 friend.
73308=Complete 3 rounds with a party consisting of at least 3 friends.
73309=Complete 3 rounds with a party consisting of at least 5 friends.
73310=Win 3 rounds on Chertanovo LZ with a fireteam.
73311=Win 3 rounds of Shearwater 51 with a fireteam.
73312=Win 3 rounds on Korolyov Towers with a fireteam.
73313=Win a conquest mode round by securing all points while in a fireteam.
73314=Win an onslaught mode round by capturing/defending all points with a fireteam.
73315=The operation was a success, we were not outflanked by the enemy thanks to the effective use of the ADS.
73316=Success! The plan worked out, they were knocked down and it gave me enough time to escape before they got back up.
73317=Thanks to the armor boost and health regeneration the Assault squad support provided, we are able to keep casualties to the minimum.
73318=Thanks to SCAN, we managed to detect the cloaked enemies and foiled their plan.
73319=The enemy morale took a huge dive after seeing their men killed out of nowhere, and retreated with their tails between their legs.
73320=With the enemy location showing up on our HUD, we were able to pick them off with ease and averted flanking movement
73321=Great job! The enemies knew what was coming when they saw the APS shield, and it drove them back.
73322=The enemies were crippled by the BLACKOUT blast, and were forced to abandon their assault.
73323=The backup came just in time before the ammunition ran out, and we were able to hold the enemies back.
73324=Awesome! The lads are pumped up with the wins we had today.
73325=Your kills today made a huge contribution and we were able to retake the position.
73326=Well done soldier, keep up this pace and you will make a fine soldier.
73327=Seems like you are quite comfortable with cover now, that should teach the enemies not to rush in fully exposed.
73328=It's important to know when to retreat and live to fight another day.
73329=We've got a lot of confirmed kills today thanks to your contribution. Keep up the good work!
73330=See, it's not that hard to handle grenades, just aim before throwing it. You did a great job flushing the enemies out from their covers.
73331=Great job! The enemies would need to reconsider the next time they launch a BLITZ charge.
73332=Well done soldier, the squad was able to advance without getting scorched.
73333=Brilliant work! They thought they were untouchable, but they learnt their mistake the hard way.
73334=Nicely done, you stopped the BLACKOUT blast just in time. The BLACKOUT blast was supposed to be the signal for enemy attack.
73335=Excellent! We are all relieved to see the pesky enemy recons getting cut down.
73336=Alright the enemy SCAN is down, this makes it so much easier for our recons to flank them. Let's roll out!
73337=I heard some praises from the squad after the huge support you give them. Keep up the good work!
73338=I'm impressed! Maybe one day you can demonstrate some of your moves to the squad.
73339=Nice throw there, you have dealt a huge blow to the opposing team.
73340=That's the right way to do it, keep working on it  and you will be a weapon against the Supports.
73341=You're becoming an expert! Keep this performance up and soon you will be expert in handling Assault Rifles.
73342=You're becoming an expert! Keep this performance up and soon you will be expert in handling Shotgun.
73343=You're becoming an expert! Keep this performance up and soon you will be expert in handling Sub-Machine Gun.
73344=You're becoming an expert! Keep this performance up and soon you will be expert in handling Sniper Rifle.
73345=You're becoming an expert! Keep this performance up and soon you will be expert in handling Light Machine Gun.
73346=Nice work soldiers, we have reduced their numbers but intel suggests that they are sending special forces in for reinforcements. This fight is just getting started.
73347=You did it! Finally the Supports are out of the way, but we have wasted previous time. Let's move, the enemies are approaching the high-value target.
73348=Very nice! No time to waste, ABI just radioed in that the enemy have reached the location. Let's move!
73349=The operation is a success! The enemy forces were forced to retreat, and we have gained control of the lost ICBM.
73350=We have landed on the oilrig's helipad and secured the entry point. We have not encountered any fierce fight yet, but something tells me this is not going to be easy.
73351=The plan worked and we managed to drive them back by working together. But expect enemy counter attack, so keep your eyes peeled.
73352=That deserves a pat on the back! The enemies have retreated to reorganize their defense. Now is the time to advance.
73353=Well done guys, we have driven the enemies back and taken control of Shearwater 51.
73354=YES! We've successfully defended the Shearwater 51 and the enemy forces have finally pulled out of the area. Thank god it's over.
73355=We have taken out the initial guards and secured the landing zone. Expect heavily resistance from now on as the enemy has been alerted of our presence.
73356=Excellent! With the enemy snipers gone, we can move forward more easily, but keep a lookout for any further enemy snipers.
73357=Great job guys! We have pushed back the enemy defense and the fight stopped for a brief moment as both sides reorganize.
73358=We have defeated the enemy defenses and taken control of the target. It's not over yet, JSOC wants us to gather hardware intel on the anti-missile system.
73359=Alright, we have gathered enough information on the hardware! Demolition charges are set, let's pull out.
73360=After completing 3 rounds, you should have a better understanding of your friends. Bring it up a notch next time by having more friends in the fireteam.
73361=Keep up the good work! Keep training to perfect your squad movements.
73362=Well done, there were some confusion and miscommunication, but keep training and you will see the results soon.
73363=Nice work soldier! Thanks to your fireteam's help we managed to push the enemy back and capture the Russian Topol.
73364=Shearwater 51 was recaptured, and successfully defended thanks to your squad.
73365=Excellent performance, your fireteam managed to overrun the enemies and they didn’t stand a chance.
73366=Excellent performance, your squad managed to overrun the enemies and they didn’t stand a chance.
73367=Well done guys, you have impressed with today's deployment and will be assessed for future difficult challenges.
73368=Pave your way to being a BLITZ Operator by unlocking these achievements.
73369=Rise through the ranks with these BLITZ achievements under your belt.
73370=Learn the ropes of using ADS through these achievements. Earn some points while you're at it too.
73371=Rise through the ranks with these ADS achievements under your belt.
73372=Sniff out enemies like a bloodhound, and you're on your way to earning all these points.
73373=No one gets through - not on your watch; and you have the achievements to prove it.
73374=Stealth your way through these achievements to attain the rank of CLOAK Operator.
73375=No one saw you sneak your way to the top with the unlocking of these achievements.
73376=Every shot deflected, and every kill chalked up brings you one step closer to rising up the Support ranks.
73377=Dominate matches with the APS shield by unlocking these achievements and rise up to the rank of Technician.
73378=Tame the intensity of BLACKOUT and you will unlock these achievements.
73379=Move up in rank as you continue to dominate with this device.
