73474=Valid between Oct 24th-30th 2011. \n Challenge yourself, rookie, with this 3-day challenge. Get 25 kills by the end of today.  If you succeed, come back tomorrow for the next mission.  If you finish all three parts, you’ll earn some extra ordinance.
73475=Valid between Oct 24th-30th 2011. \n Two more days left.  Today’s challenge will be harder.  Get 60 kills by the end of today.  If you succeed, come back tomorrow for the last mission.
73476=Valid between Oct 24th-30th 2011. \n This is the hardest part, but you’re almost done. Get 150 kills by the end of today.
