73901=Used to disrupt incoming enemy projectiles, the APS is most effective when fully charged[F] before activation[F].  Be sure not to let the APS overheat, or it will temporarily knock out your HUD and Cross Coms.
73902=This EMP device is most effective when fully charged[F] before activation[F].  In addition to disabling active devices of nearby enemies BLACKOUT also serves to impair their ability to see and return fire. Be sure not to let BLACKOUT overheat or you will suffer the effects yourself.
73903=This shield offers protection and provides a drastic speed boost through the exoskeleton.  These two aspects of BLITZ result in a mobile unit that can charge and knock down enemies.  Once activated[F] BLITZ can be cancelled[F] at any time or by shooting but your energy pool will be depleted.
73904=ADS creates feelings of extreme pain in targets, temporarily suppressing them.  Activation[F] of ADS also activates a thermal imaging system to allow for more accurate target acquisition.  ADS can be cancelled[F] at any time but your energy pool will be completely depleted.
73905=This optical camouflage can be activated[F] and deactivated[F] at any time that sufficient energy remains although activation depletes energy faster than sustained use.  Being shot and running both increase the rate at which energy is expended while in CLOAK and firing a weapon deactivates it.
73906=Used to detect enemy personnel even through solid walls, SCAN can be activated[F] and deactivated[F] at any time that sufficient energy remains although activation depletes energy faster than sustained use.  Detected enemy intel is shared with all nearby allies.
73907=HOW TO USE DEVICES
73908=Voice Chat is activated by pressing [Alt] by default.
