73947=TECH SUPPORT
73948=The Common military pack provides basic equipment for the soldier on the go.
73949=The Rare military pack supplies tactical equipment to militants in the heat of combat.
73950=The Legendary pack supplies cutting-edge equipment to the elite on the battlefield.
73951=Model 29
73952=Purchase GC
73953=FIREARMS DRILL
73954=The Assault class specializes in Assault Rifles and Shotguns. Assault rifles are all-rounder weapons ideal in short-medium range combat, while Shotguns deal high damage at close range. Pick the right weapon that suits your combat style and take out 15 enemies.
73955=Kill a total of 15 enemies with an Assault Rifle or Shotgun.
73956=You are encouraged to try out both weapon classes to see which fits you better. In the next training, you will be introduced to the Assault class devices.
73957=The Recon class specializes in handling Sniper Rifles and Sub-machine guns. Sniper rifles are ideal for long range engagements, while Sub-machine guns excel at close quarters combat. Pick the right weapon that suits your combat style and take out 15 enemies.
73958=Kill a total of 15 enemies with a Sniper Rifle or Sub-Machine Gun.
73959=You are encouraged to try out both weapon classes to see which fits you better. In the next training, you will be introduced to the Recon class devices.
73960=The Support class specializes in Light Machine Guns (LMG) and Shotguns. LMGs suppress mid-range targets with a high rate of fire, while Shotguns deal high damage at close range. Pick the right weapon that suits your combat style and take out 15 enemies.
73961=Kill a total of 15 enemies with a Light Machine Gun or Shotgun.
73962=You are encouraged to try out both weapon classes to see which fits you better. In the next training, you will be introduced to the Support class devices.
73963=EYES ON YOU
73964=Effective use of SCAN can play a crucial part in team success. In today's operation, intel on the enemy's location will be needed for us to outmanoeuvre and flank the them. Your effectiveness in SCAN will be tested, detect 24 enemies with SCAN.
73965=Detect 24 enemies with SCAN in a round.
73966=Thanks to SCAN, we were able to time our ambush perfectly and they didn’t stand a chance. Great work!
73967=TROUBLE IS BREWING
73968=A well timed BLACKOUT on multiple enemies will cripple their effectiveness and give your squad the advantage. Always try to charge up to it's maximum power to affect as many targets as possible.  Your challenge today is to affect 9 enemies with your BLACKOUT.
73969=Use BLACKOUT on 9 enemies in total.
73970=I knew you could do it, your squad was able to gain an advantage over the crippled enemy thanks to your contribution.
73971=GUNSLINGER
73972=The Handgun is a great backup to the primary weapon. It can be drawn quickly, allowing keep sustained fire on the enemy. Give it a try and kill 15 enemies with the Handgun. Remember, always keep yours fully loaded.
73973=Kill a total of 15 enemies with a Pistol.
73974=You are learning fast, keep practicing with the handgun and you will be rewarded when the need arises.
73975=BURST FIRE
73976=Assault rifles are accurate at mid-range, but still require a number of shots to make the kill. To be more efficient, aim for the neck of the enemy and take controlled burst shots. The recoil will guide the shots to the head, inflicting more damage for the kill.
73977=Achieve a total of 15 headshot kills with Assault Rifle.
73978=You've just about mastered it, keep working to improve your Assault Rifle proficiency.
73979=BOOMSTICK
73980=The bullet spread on shotguns makes them ineffective at long range, but lethal at close range. At point blank range (<5 metres), you can take out an enemy with a well placed shot.  Get close to 10 enemies and kill them at point blank range.
73981=Kill a total of 10 enemies with Shotgun at point-blank range.
73982=You've just about mastered it, keep working to improve your Shotgun proficiency.
73983=NEUROLOGIST
73984=Sub-machine guns' lower damage require more shots to make the kill. However, the SMG excels at close range as its high rate of fire and high control allows accurate aim for maximum damage.
73985=Achieve a total of 15 headshot kills with the Sub-Machine gun.
73986=You've just about mastered it, keep working to improve your Sub-Machine gun proficiency.
73987=LONG RANGE HUNTING
73988=Sniping enemies at distances above their effective range is crucial. It creates a suppression effect as they are unable to return accurate fire and risk getting hit. To be effective at long range, use a high magnification scope and make use of cover for better aim.
73989=Kill a total of 10 enemies with Sniper Rifle from distance of 50 metres.
73990=You've just about mastered it, keep working to improve your Sniper Rifle proficiency.
73991=SQUAD AUTOMATIC WEAPON
73992=Light machine guns have high rate of fire and huge ammo capacity, and are best used to provide suppressing fire from fixed positions at medium range. Your job is to suppress and pin enemies down while your squad flanks to make the kill.
73993=Deal a total of 4000 damage with Light Machine Gun.
73994=You've just about mastered it, keep working to improve your Light Machine Gun proficiency.
73995=Improve your GRP Matchmaking
73996=Please exit the Launcher and try again later.
