74044=Back To Basics
74045=Stripped down to just a handgun, a Ghost should still be effective on the battlefield. These achievements prove exactly that.
74046=15 kills with handgun
74047=5 headshot kills with a handgun
74048=Kill an opponent who is also using a handgun
74049=Deadlier When Down
74050=An injured soldier on the battlefield is even deadlier.
74051=Kill 3 opponents when your health is less than 50
74052=Capture a point when health is less than 50
74053=Win a round when your health is less than 50
74054=Regenerate your health when it is less than 30, 3 times per life
74055=Outrun My Gun
74056=Be the perfect embodiment of the saying "Speed kills".
74057=Make 4 kills in 10 seconds (with weapons only)
74058=Kill an opponent within the first 30 seconds of a round
74059=Capture 3 points in a round
74060=All In A Day's Work
74061=An Assault's work is never done. These achievements show how we do it, Assault-style.
74062=Blitz 20 enemies off the map
74063=Increase the armor of 50 squad members with Harden Armor
74064=Kill 15 enemies with grenades
74065=Heat n' Heal
74066=An Assault with the right devices makes all the difference in the heat of battle. Literally.
74067=Regenerate 500 points of your squad members' health
74068=Perform 300 points of damage with ADS
74069=Perform 20 defensive kills with a shotgun
74070=Came, Saw, Conquered
74071=Victory is of utmost importance in this group of achievements. Success lies in your hands, and those of your squad members.
74072=Win 10 matches on the Chertanovo LZ
74073=Win 10 matches on the Shearwater 51
74074=Win 10 matches on the Korolyov Towers.
74075=Win 10 matches on Markov Station
74076=Demolitions Expert
74077=It takes a real munitions expert to unlock these achievements. Track your wins with these repeatables.
74078=Kill 2 enemies with a single grenade
74079=In a round, kill 4 enemies with grenades
74080=Kill  more than  4 enemies with a single grenade
74081=Kill yourself, along with your enemies with a grenade
74082=I Spy With My Eye
74083=1st Enemy Detected Using SCAN
74084=Good Night
74085=It’s a sniper's job to put enemies to sleep. Tuck them into bed with these long distance achievements.
74086=Trenchbroom
74087=With the SMG, housekeeping on the battlefield has never been easier. This checklist of achievements should come in handy.
74088=Perform 20 attack kills with the SMG
74089=Easy Pickings
74090=Opponents become easy pickings for the Recon with SCAN and the Gunshot Detector squad support. No team is complete without the Recon!
74091=Detect 20 enemies hiding behind cover
74092=Highlight 30 shooting enemies with Shoot Detection
74093=Kill 15 enemies with grenades
74094=The Invisible Threat
74095=What is invisible to the eye can be invincible. Like a sharpshooting Recon who is cloaked.
74096=Detect moving enemies and share the intel with 50 allies using Motion Detector
74097=Perform 50 headshot kills with the sniper rifle
74098=Kill a Blitzing Assault with a sniper rifle
74099=Hose 'Em Down
74100=The perfect weapon for suppression, light machine guns keep your opponents at bay, and your capture points clear.
74101=Scattergun
74102=These shotgun achievements mark the start of a Support's journey with one of the most forceful weapons in the game.
74103=Perform 5 kill assists
74104=10 backstab kills using a shotgun
74105=APS Protector
74106=The APS shield is one of the Support's most formidable equipments on the battlefield. These achievements prove your proficiency in using the shield.
74107=Capture a point with the APS shield deployed
74108=Kill 20 enemies with a shotgun with the Aegie shield up
74109=Protect a squad member with a deployed APS shield
74110=Charge Up
74111=Squad support completely change the outcome of a battle - good squad support can be more formidable than any weapon.
74112=BLACKOUT 20 enemies who are using their devices
74113=Help 20 squad members charge up their device with Energy Supplier
74114=Kill 20 enemies who have been disabled by your device
74115=Squad Supplier
74116=When used with another device, the Ammo Supplier can be key to a squad's victory. Track your progress via these achievements
74117=Replenish a total of 500 rounds for your squad members with Ammo Supplier
74118=Deflect 300 rounds of bullets with your APS shield
74119=Capture 5 points with your APS shield up
