74227=TIP: Complete achievements to receive new avatars.
74228=Step into the boots of an elite Ghost with advanced weaponry and engage in tactical cover-based gameplay.
74229=Pick from 3 Classes - Assault, Support or Recon to suit your strategy and play-style.
74230=Customize and upgrade your character as you level up and unlock new weapons and equipment.
74231=Engage in fierce and visceral 16 player online firefights with your friends.
74232=To buy cool weapons, upgrades and equipment for your character, you need ATHENA Credits %s or Ghost Coins %s.
74233=%s is earned by completing Matches and Daily Challenges. It can be used to buy most items in the Store.
74234=%s , on the other hand, can be purchased via online payments or pre-paid cards.
74235=While %s offers the convenience for players with less time to attain the desired items, they still have to ‘earn’ the right to use them by reaching the level requirements.
74236=ATHENA CREDITS & GHOST COINS
