74241=Congratulations on creating your first character!\n You have been awarded with 1000 AC!\n \n Click NEXT to learn how to purchase an item.
74242=Basic Training: Purchasing Item (%s/%s)
74243=Upgrading your gear is a major part of playing Ghost Recon Phantoms. For a start, buy some grenades from the Store.
74244=Action: Click on [STORE] on the top navigation menu to browse items.
74245=Items are organized into respective categories, only displaying items your class can use.
74246=Action: Click on the “CONSUMABLES” category to access grenades.
74247=Detailed item information is displayed when you mouse over.
74248=Action: Click on this grenade to open the purchase menu.
74249=You can buy more grenade packs by changing the quantity.
74250=You can pay by either %s or %s for most items in the store. However some items may require a specific currency.
74251=Action: Click [BUY] to complete purchase.
74252=Basic Training: Equipping an Item (%s/%s)
74253=Item has been added to the Storage section of your Inventory, but needs to be equipped before you can use it.
74254=Action: Click on [INVENTORY] on the top navigation menu.
74255=Equipped items take effect in game, and can be changed while waiting to spawn.
74256=Basic Training: Starting a Match (%s/%s)
74257=Now that you have grenades equipped, you are ready for your first match.
74258=Action: Click on [PLAY] on the top navigation menu to access the MODE SELECTION screen.
74259=The match making system finds an ideal match for you by searching for suitable players and on-going matches.
74260=Action: Click on [START SEARCH] to join the Multiplayer queue.
74261=Use the Firing Range to try out the game controls and weapons.
74262=You can access more information about the game via the intel icon.
74263=Action: Click on grenade item to equip.
