74802=Grenade Crate: Small
74803=A grenade crate lying around without a label. You get 25 grenades or more if you are lucky.
74804=Grenade Crate: Medium
74805=A large box that contains at least 50 grenades. There might be something else rattling around in there.
74806=Grenade Crate: Large
74807=A heavy crate that contains at least 100 grenades. There is definitely something else in the box.
74808=Starter Bundle: SMG
74809=Recommended starting kit for an offensive Recon to excel in close quarters combat.
74810=Starter Bundle: SR
74811=Recommended starting kit for a Sniper Recon to deal with long range targets.
74812=Starter Bundle: AR
74813=Recommended starting kit for an all-rounder Assault to engage in short to medium range combat.
74814=Starter Bundle: SG
74815=Recommended starting kit for an aggressive Shotgun Assault to take down enemies in an instant.
74816=Recommended starting kit for an aggressive Shotgun Support to take down enemies in an instant.
74817=Starter Bundle: LMG
74818=Recommended starting kit for a support Support to lay down heavy suppressive fire.
74819=CB Bundle
74820=Reward for players who participated in the Closed Beta.
74821=Elite CB Bundle
74822=Reward for players who participated in the Closed Beta and achieved level 20 or higher.
