74846=Class Stats
74847=Provides updates on your character and friends' activities.
74848=You can access different game features or buy items via these buttons.
74849=Your avatar, AC, GC and achievement points persist across all characters. Experience points and level, on the other hand, are per character.
74850=You can switch class in the lobby, but class choice is locked once the match starts.
74851=Meet new players via Chat, or interact with your friends via Social.
74852=Some system messages you will receive:/n - Players adding you to friend  list/n - Items received when Inventory is full/n - Messages from Game Master
74853=Friends list allows you to view your friends' status, and interact with them via right-click.
74854=By adding players to ignore list, you block their chat, whispers and invites.
74855=Players are matched together based on various conditions to provide a fun and smooth experience.
74856=There can be up to 2 rounds per match, after that a different map will be chosen at random.
74857=Play with your friends by inviting them to your fireteam.
74858=Accept 1 challenge from each category and complete them to earn more rewards.
74859=Challenges are refreshed each day, providing new challenges.
74860=Some challenges require you to complete them in sequence. Challenge chains provide greater rewards when completed.
74861=Upon completing each round, XP and AC are rewarded based on performance and time played. In addition, a loot box is rewarded if you are lucky.
74862=Open the loot box from Inventory to find out what it contains. Legendary loot boxes have the highest chance of giving valuable items.
74863=As your character levels up you earn rewards and unlock new weapons and equipment.
74864=Progress in weapon proficiency, achievements, challenges and events can be viewed here.
74865=Items purchased or received from rewards are sent to your Storage. You can buy additional storage space from the store.
74866=Items must be equipped in loadout in order to be used during a match. They can also be changed mid-game during respawn.
74867=All characters share the same storage space.
74868=Unwanted items can be sold to scrapyard for AC. Sold items can be bought back within a limited time period.
74869=Items can be bought with AC or GC. AC is earned by playing the game, and GC offers convenience for players with less time to attain their desired items.
74870=Mouse over items to view more information. Use the compare function to compare multiple items at the same time.
74871=Locked items can be purchased but cannot be equipped unless you fulfill the class and level requirement.
74872=Weapons, devices and Tactical Suits are permanent items. Other items such as grenades, special ammo and boosts are consumables.
74873=Purchased items will be sent to the Inventory. However, if you do not have enough storage space, it will be sent to Inbox.
74874=Items not available for currently selected class are filtered out automatically.
74875=Weapon variants are preconfigured to suit different play styles.
74876=Click on the weapon to access customization options and upgrade your gun to its full potential.
74877=Devices with customization options are unlocked at a higher level.
74878=Click on the device to access customization options and upgrade your device.
74879=Squad Support provides automatic perks to you and nearby squad members.
74880=Headgear provides an aesthetic upgrade to your character. The change is changed automatically to match the Tactical Suit's camo pattern.
74881=Tactical Suit at higher levels not only has better tactical suit attributes, but they have more upgrade slots, increasing your character's survivability.
74882=Click on the Tactical Suit to access customization options and outfit it with different types of Tactical Suit upgrades.
74883=Consumables are items that depreciate and can expire.
74884=Only 2 grenades are carried on each spawn.
74885=Storage items permanently increases your storage space.
74886=Tactical Suit upgrades are equipped onto tactical suit. If a Tactical Suit is equipped during a match, its durability will be reduced per game round.
74887=Special ammo is equipped onto weapons and requires a manual toggle to use during match. It depletes per shot fired.
74888=Boost items allows you to earn extra XP and AC each match, but they have limited time duration.
74889=In Profile, you can view your character information such as achievements, stats, weapon proficiency, and leaderboard.
74890=Complete tiered achievements to gain achievement points and receive new avatars.
74891=Medals are repeatable achievements earned in each round.
74892=Events are special objectives that you can complete within a limited time period to earn big rewards.
74893=View class statistics accumulated in lifetime or the last 7 days.
74894=Increase your weapon proficiency by killing enemies. Higher weapon proficiency improves the weapon's critical rate.
74895=Critical rate refers to the chance of dealing significantly increased damage.
74896=Variants of each weapon share the same weapon proficiency level.
74897=View your class ranking against friends and other players in the lifetime and weekly leaderboards.
