74947=Game Mode
74948=Press Space to start match
74949=Hotjoining a match
74950=In a close quarters fight, switching to handgun is faster than reloading your primary weapon
74951=Melee attack is the last resort for close quarters combat. [Mouse wheel button] by default
74952=Cover your squad members as they advance, avoid advancing together without any covering fire
74953=Make use of the voice comms to coordinate strategies and share enemy information with your squad
74954=When isolated, regroup with your squad; strength in numbers
74955=DMG. mitigation tac. suit upgrades are most effective against low damage per shot weapons such as shotguns
74956=Critical mitigation tac. suit upgrades protects you against veterans who are highly experienced with their weapon class
74957=Max. Health Tactical Suit upgrades increase the amount of damage you can sustain
74958=Health Regen Tactical Suit upgrades allow significantly quicker recovery from injuries.
74959=A grenade rolled on the ground can be an effective counter-attack to the APS shield. [Right mouse button] by default.
74960=The LMG can be a great suppression weapon to help your squadmates move forward.
74961=You can change the firemode on some weapons with [X] by default
74962=You can change the third person camera from left to right shoulder by pressing [Q] by default
74963=A Recon with Motion Detector can pinpoint the location of any running enemies - even if they are cloaked.
74964=Bigger magazine clips  tend to take longer to reload.
74965=Short bursts of fire helps control recoil and accuracy
74966=Use a 1.5x scope or higher when you intend to engage middle to long range.
74967=When in prone position you can roll sideways. Move and [Space] by default
74968=The laser designator faciliates team coordination by showing where you are aiming and tagging spotted enemies
74969=The laser designator allows you to put a waypoint on the environment by pressing [T] by default
74970=You can check your personal stats, achievements, and leaderboards in the PROFILE in the lobby.
74971=Shooting from cover improves weapon accuracy, stability, and control.
74972=Check your ghost feed on HOME for information on achievements, levelling, missions, and more.
74973=Completing events gives you attractive rewards
74974=Earn more ATHENA Credits from your play session by taking on daily challenges from the HOME screen
74975=Every match you can achieve and collect Medals and it will be accumulated in your Profile.
74976=You can sell items back to the Scrapyard and recover a percentage of the original price.
74977=If you enjoyed playing with someone, add them to your Friends list by right-clicking on their name in the scoreboard
74978=Share your role and strategy before the match starts, any kind of information helps your team
74979=If another player is bothering you, you can right-click on their name and choose “Ignore”.
74980=Daily Missions are a great way to earn more every day as you play the game.
74981=Your chances of dealing critical damage increases with a stable aim
74982=At the end of each round, there is a small chance to receive a loot drop, indicated by a star icon beside your name
74983=Shooting an enemy's arm or leg deals less damage compared with the head or torso.
74984=When encountering enemy BLITZ, move to a position that is harder to reach or shoot at his legs
74985=Check the damage log on the respawn screen to understand what kind of damage you've taken.
74986=Always communicate enemy locations with your squad, especially if you were killed from behind
74987=Always monitor how many bullets left in the magazine, reload if it is not enough to kill
74988=A Recon using CLOAK is able to see your Laser Designator beam if you are looking down the scope
74989=While using the Assault's ADS device, mouse wheel up for a more concentrated arc of effect
74990=You can change class after a match has been found. Don't overload your squad with any one class.
74991=If your inventory storage is full, new items will be placed in your Inbox.
74992=You can switch chat channels in the lobby - Squad, Match, or Public.
74993=During a match, press [,] to chat with your squad and [.] to chat with everyone.
74994=Vertical foregrips allow weapons to be readied faster.
74995=The bipod's benefits only apply when in cover or prone stance
74996=Use a higher magnification scope for long-range engagements
74997=Semi-automatic fire mode improves accuracy and control, suitable for long-range engagements
74998=It's possible for headshots to be critical hits, causing massive damage.
74999=Weapon damage decreases over range, making small caliber weapons and shotguns ineffective at longer ranges
75000=There is no center bullet.
75001=The Support's BLACKOUT device can affect enemies behind a wall
75002=Grenades deal less damage at the edges of their explosion radius.
75003=HEAVY TAC. SUIT provides better protection, while LIGHT TAC. SUIT allows faster movement speed
75004=Listening for footsteps improves your awareness of the enemy's location
75005=A glancing melee blow does less damage than a direct hit.
75006=DMG. Mitigation Tactical Suit upgrades also reduce melee damage.
75007=Keeping your screen still helps you spot an enemy CLOAK more easily
75008=Conserve your Recon's device energy by deactivating when not needed
75009=Enemies exposed to the Assault ADS device are unable to return fire and take damage over time
75010=Always have someone defending the flanking route, a successful backstab can inflict heavy casualties
75011=If it’s too quiet, you’re probably being flanked.
75012=Check all slash commands by typing '/help' or '/?' on the chat field.
75013=Check your score or personal stats on scoreboard. [TAB] by default.
75014=In respawn screen in the match you can check other player's personal stats such as kills or assists by [L MOUSE CLICK] on the other player after pressing [TAB].
75015=If detected by SCAN, you're already spotted. Better to move to another location.
