76248=Get rewarded for drafting your teammates
76249=Learn more
76250=Draft your teammates and get rewarded
76251=Great news! You are now handsomely rewarded when you draft your teammates to join you in Ghost Recon Phantoms!
76252=You can only invite new players to be your teammates, and as soon as they reach level 5 or higher, they will be counted towards your overall rewards achievement
76253=The more teammates you draft, the greater the rewards
76254=Once you or your friends have been drafted, it is permanent and cannot be reversed
76255=So start drafting your teammates now
76256=Draft Teammates Now
76257=Drafting teammates has never been so rewarding! Not only will you have more friends to game with, you'll get to enjoy more rewards when you draft more friends.
76258=To learn more about the rewards, click here
76259=You have proved your warrior ethos by staying with your squad throughout the matches.
76260=Your contribution today was valuable to the squad, keep it up!
76261=Now that you have learned the benefits of lowering your stance, apply it to your play style.
76262=Congratulations, you have proven to be a competent soldier. Tip: You can view the medals that you have earned in Profile.
76263=Now that you have more experience with the 3 classes, you will be better at dealing with different enemy classes.
76264=Put your versatility to good use by choosing the right class to compliment your squad members.
76265=Nicely done guys. Play more often in a fireteam and hone your coordination skills to perfection.
76266=Great work soldiers, keep this up and you should be able to rack up wins more often.
76267=I will always place the mission first. I will never accept defeat. I will never quit. I will never leave a fallen comrade. - U.S. Army Warrior Ethos
76268=The best soldiers focus on the objectives because that is the most important factor to winning. Stay close to the control points to eliminate attackers or defenders, these kills count for more.
76269=In a firefight where you can't find cover, lower your stance to present as little a target to the enemy as possible. Your chances of winning a firefight also increases as you have improved weapon accuracy in a lower stance.
76270=Medals are awarded to soldiers who have displayed competency in various different combat aspects. Prove that you are worthy of being a Ghost by winning 7 medals.
76271=Knowing the strengths and weaknesses of all 3 classes allows you to make the right decisions when facing enemies. Practice playing as the 3 classes today by completing 2 rounds each.
76272=A good Ghost Recon soldier excels with 1 specific class, but a great Ghost Recon soldier excels at all 3 classes. Prove that you can be versatile by killing 10 enemies as each of the 3 classes.
76273=When in a fireteam, stick close to each other and move as a unit, covering each other in the process. Coordinate your pushes with well timed devices and you will be unstoppable.
76274=Whether you are organizing a defense line or staging an offensive attack on the enemy base, it is important that the fireteam focuses on the same objective and works together. Stay close to the objective areas to make the kills count.
76275=A SOLDIER NEVER QUITS
