76908=These icons (I,II, III, IV) represent the item's Requisition Tier.\n \nPurchasing an item unlocks purchase access to the next higher tier in the item category for currently selected class.\n \nFor example: Purchasing HEAVY TAC. SUIT I will unlock purchase access to HEAVY TAC. SUIT II.
