78232=BUY GHOST COIN PACKAGE
78233=What Are Ghost Coins?
78234=Ghost Coins are the premium currency that can be used in Ghost Recon Phantoms to purchase unlocked gear, weapon variants, upgrades and in game boosts. You can also use Ghost Coins to buy limited edition variants and cosmetic upgrades.
78235=What are my payment options?
78236=You can choose to pay with credit cards, PayPal, or select pre-paid cards. In addition to that, your region may support bank transfers or mobile payments. Different bundles are available for mobile payment options.
78237=What currency will I be billed in?
78238=Bundles are available in various denominations for Euro or Pound sterling. If you reside outside of European Union (EU), your credit card provider may levy conversion charges.
78239=Learn more about the store in the Beginner's Guide
