78446=Looks and Power
78447=Looks meet power with each of these striking Assault Tier 1 Special Editions, crafted to help you dominate on the battlefield.
78448=Has better fire rate and maximum accuracy spread for closer range engagements. But it has less damage, control, and accuracy.
78449=Standard barrel, versatile for most scenarios.
78450=Better damage, control, and accuracy for longer range engagements. But it has poorer fire rate and maximum accuracy spread.
78451=Has better fire rate and bigger spread for closer range engagements. But it has less damage and control.
78452=Better damage, control, and smaller spread for longer range engagements. But it has lower fire rate.
78453=Has better fire rate and quicker target acquisition for closer range engagements. But it has less damage, control, and accuracy.
78454=Better damage, control, and accuracy for longer range engagements. But it has lower fire rate and slower target acquisition.
78455=Improves control and sway but increases ready time.
78456=Greatly improves hip-fire accuracy, but it reduces accuracy when in cover or aiming down sight.
78457=Reduces ready time at the expense of minor control reduction.
78458=Standard issue magazine.
78459=Bigger magazine size and ammo pool.
78460=Reloads 1 shell at a time, but can be interrupted to fire immediately.
78461=High capacity magazine that provides a large amount of bullets, but at the expense of high reload time.
78462=Looks meet power with each of these striking Recon Tier 1 Special Editions, crafted to help you dominate on the battlefield.
78463=Looks meet power with each of these striking Support Tier 1 Special Editions, crafted to help you dominate on the battlefield.
78464=Same magazine size, but faster reload.
